  "notes": "Cause code left TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields (official code was 'TBD'), even though narrative attributes root cause to inadequate institutionalization of prior T-ring relaxation knowledge (personnel/organizational theme). Minipurge valves GTHZ0004/0005 and blind flange are described mainly for design context/safety significance, but GTHZ0005 was explicitly closed/de-energized per TS LCO 3.6.3 Condition D and is part of the same penetration leak-path measurement, so it is modeled as a Component but not asserted as an operable BACKED_UP_BY system since it did not independently maintain containment isolation function on its own (containment was still declared inoperable). No BACKED_UP_BY edges asserted: no separate operable system explicitly maintained the safety function during the inoperability window. No previous similar occurrence (OE section states 'None'), so no stub LER/SIMILAR_TO edge emitted per rule 9 conditionality."
